    "wasted_work": "Only verified harmful chains (read + behavior change + harm) contribute: original-producer work invalidated by replacement artifact plus downstream work after injection and before termination. Units remain separate.",
    "end_to_end_latency": "Wall-clock difference from run_started.timestamp to run_finished.timestamp.",
    "fault_visibility": "signaled means the downstream artifact contains explicit fault/status labels; silent means experiment-only labels are omitted from model-visible artifact content."
